Promote direct PDF quote upload support and site-consistency hardening.

This release fixes the upload mismatch where the interface accepted PDF files but automatic extraction only handled JPG/PNG/WebP. PDFs are now rendered locally in the browser using a same-origin bundled PDF.js build, converted to a transient WebP image and passed into the existing quote-analysis flow. The original PDF is not uploaded separately or stored by this bridge.

The UI now accurately states that screenshots, photos and PDFs are supported. Up to the first 12 pages of a PDF are prepared for analysis, with progress and fallback messaging if conversion fails.

This promotion also preserves the live Stripe configuration and dashboard-managed Cloudflare secrets. The production consistency audit remains active for broken links, graphics, browser errors and responsive layout defects.

